# 테스트용 가짜 Firebase 인증 플러그인(window.__FR_AUTH_PLUGIN). 로그인한 사용자는 localStorage 'fake.u' 에 유지(재시작 시 세션 복원 흉내).
FAKE = """window.__FR_AUTH_PLUGIN={get _u(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('fake.u')||'null')}catch(e){return null}},async getCurrentUser(){return {user:this._u}},async signInWithGoogle(){if(window.__mode==='cancel')throw new Error('12501 cancelled');localStorage.setItem('fake.u',JSON.stringify({uid:'u1',email:'jae@example.com',displayName:'Jae Test'}));return {user:this._u}},async signOut(){localStorage.removeItem('fake.u')},async deleteUser(){localStorage.removeItem('fake.u')}};"""
